OL,3,GNEWSATown seeks backing for culture bid
OL,4,
OL,5,FPeople in Grimsby are being asked to
OL,6,Fshow Town of Culture 2028 judges what
OL,7,Fthe town means to them.
OL,9,FOrganisers behind the bid want people
OL,10,Facross Grimsby to share their stories
OL,11,Fand ideas as they prepare their
OL,12,Fsubmission for the title.
OL,14,FGrimsby has reached the final shortlist
OL,15,Fof four large towns, alongside
OL,16,FBasildon, Birkenhead and Rotherham.
OL,18,FThe final bid has to be submitted by 30
OL,19,FNovember, with the winner due to be
OL,20,Fannounced in March 2027.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
